# AmberCell FTP provider — pure-ftpd CLI flags
# Rendered at container start: @PASV_ADDRESS@ ← AMBER_FTP_PASV_ADDRESS
#
# Alpine's packaged pure-ftpd is not used for the daemon binary; we ship a
# 1.0.51 build with Active Mode patched off (see disable-active-mode.patch).
# Flags keep PASV 30000-30049, ForcePassiveIP, anonymous + unix auth, chroot.
#
# One flag/argument per line. Blank lines and # comments are ignored.

-4
-A
-H
-Z
-f
none
-l
unix
-u
100
-U
022:022
-g
/tmp/pure-ftpd.pid
-p
30000:30049
-P
@PASV_ADDRESS@
